    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Sliding window (count windows)</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/subarray-product-less-than-k/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 713</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Subarray Product Less Than K</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">All values are positive, so a longer window never has a smaller product: keep the longest valid window ending at each right edge, shrink it from the left while the product is at least k, and add its length to the count. O(n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
  },
